                                                "example_id": "06f7c523-bb1e-47e4-88ad-a535ae7705a9",
                                                "sense_id": "7fa9c8ba-3df6-3996-9c59-6a55da872a2c",
                                                "text": "[…] For a Diſcord it ſelfe is but a Harſhneſſe of Diuers Sounds Meeting."
